{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-extractfeaturemaptypestfeatures-tfeaturemap","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TFeatureMap>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TFeatureMap> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? UnionToIntersection<TFeatureMap[keyof TFeatureMap]> : UnionToIntersectionOrEmpty<TFeatureMap[Extract<keyof TFeatures, keyof TFeatureMap>]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L43","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types/TableFeatures.ts:43"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extracts the API/types contributed by the features present in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatureMap"},{"type":"text","value":" maps feature keys to the types they contribute. When\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":", all feature-map entries are included to preserve the\npermissive behavior expected by broad table types. Otherwise, only entries\nwhose keys are present in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" are intersected together."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeaturemap","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatureMap"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatureMap"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-extractfeaturemaptypestfeatures-tfeaturemap","text":"Type Alias: ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TFeatureMap>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tfeaturemap","text":"TFeatureMap","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: ExtractFeatureMapTypes\\<TFeatures, TFeatureMap\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TFeatureMap> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? UnionToIntersection<TFeatureMap[keyof TFeatureMap]> : UnionToIntersectionOrEmpty<TFeatureMap[Extract<keyof TFeatures, keyof TFeatureMap>]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L43)\n\nExtracts the API/types contributed by the features present in `TFeatures`.\n\n`TFeatureMap` maps feature keys to the types they contribute. When\n`TFeatures` is `any`, all feature-map entries are included to preserve the\npermissive behavior expected by broad table types. Otherwise, only entries\nwhose keys are present in `TFeatures` are intersected together.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TFeatureMap\n\n`TFeatureMap` *extends* `object`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ExtractFeatureMapTypes\ntitle: ExtractFeatureMapTypes\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ExtractFeatureMapTypes\\<TFeatures, TFeatureMap\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TFeatureMap> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? UnionToIntersection<TFeatureMap[keyof TFeatureMap]> : UnionToIntersectionOrEmpty<TFeatureMap[Extract<keyof TFeatures, keyof TFeatureMap>]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableFeatures.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableFeatures.ts#L43)\n\nExtracts the API/types contributed by the features present in `TFeatures`.\n\n`TFeatureMap` maps feature keys to the types they contribute. When\n`TFeatures` is `any`, all feature-map entries are included to preserve the\npermissive behavior expected by broad table types. Otherwise, only entries\nwhose keys are present in `TFeatures` are intersected together.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TFeatureMap\n\n`TFeatureMap` *extends* `object`\n"}
